{
  "_description": "Challenge baseline: one doublet at 2,500 m, built from GEMINI's doublet_plant.json. Not a proposed design and not expected to reach 100 C. It tests the challenge inputs in the existing layout. All water passes the heat exchanger and boiler, and all gas goes to the boiler; the CHP branch is kept but carries no flow.",
