  "_demo_values_kept": "Well ID 0.15 m, default roughness 0.01 m, ESP depth, stages, curves and 65 Hz, separator and filter resistances and 1 C temperature drops, heat exchanger size, secondary flow 140 m3/h, boiler efficiency 0.8, electricity emission factor 0.3 kg/kWh.",
  "_known_limits": "The well model uses fixed water properties (1,000 kg/m3 and 1 mPa.s), not the challenge brine, and they cannot be set from this file. ESP power comes from its pump curve, not from the required 70% efficiency. The script's KPI helpers use fixed 1,050 kg/m3 and 4,200 J/kg.K and expect these component names.",
